      "description": "側欄上唯一的實心主動作；監控中轉為描邊的「停止監控」。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-rail-demo\"><button class=\"ds-btn-connect\">開始監控</button><button class=\"ds-btn-connect ds-is-connected\">停止監控</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-rail-demo{display:grid;gap:12px;padding:20px;background:var(--rail,#1b4f8f);} .ds-btn-connect{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-lg,6px);background:var(--rail-ink,#eef3fa);color:var(--rail,#1b4f8f);font:700 15px/1 \"Microsoft JhengHei UI\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),color 160ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);} .ds-btn-connect:hover{background:#ffffff;} .ds-btn-connect:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--rail-ink-2,#c3d3e8);outline-offset:2px;} .ds-btn-connect.ds-is-connected{border:1.5px solid var(--rail-ink,#eef3fa);background:transparent;color:var(--rail-ink,#eef3fa);} .ds-btn-connect.ds-is-connected:hover{background:rgba(238,243,250,.1);}"
