      "refersTo": "tint-lowland",
      "description": "六段地形分層色階加洋紅指針，旁為 Display 級高度讀數。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-alt\"><div class=\"ds-ladder\"><span style=\"background:var(--t5,#b47566)\"></span><span style=\"background:var(--t4,#cd916c)\"></span><span style=\"background:var(--t3,#e2b27c)\"></span><span style=\"background:var(--t2,#ecd391)\"></span><span style=\"background:var(--t1,#e2e6a8)\"></span><span style=\"background:var(--t0,#cfe0bb)\"></span><i class=\"ds-pin\" style=\"bottom:70%\"></i></div><div><p class=\"ds-alt-label\">相對高度</p><p class=\"ds-alt-value\"><strong>635.1</strong><span>m</span></p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-alt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:20px;background:var(--paper,#edf0ea);color:var(--ink,#0f1b2d);} .ds-ladder{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-rows:repeat(6,1fr);min-height:150px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#9eaaa0);border-radius:3px;} .ds-pin{position:absolute;left:-4px;right:-4px;height:3px;background:var(--rocket,#a3166f);transition:bottom 500ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);} .ds-pin::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-10px;top:-5.5px;border:7px solid transparent;border-left:8px solid var(--rocket,#a3166f);border-right:0;} .ds-alt-label{margin:0;color:var(--ink-2,#435168);font:500 15px \"Microsoft JhengHei UI\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;} .ds-alt-value{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:8px 0 0;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-alt-value strong{font-size:96px;font-weight:600;line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.035em;} .ds-alt-value span{color:var(--ink-2,#435168);font-size:24px;font-weight:600;}"
    },
    {
